| Strength ratio threshold \(\delta\) | Mean test accuracy (%) |
| --- | --- |
| ~0.35 | ~53 |
| 0.5 | ~36 |
| ~0.65 | ~15 |
| ~0.75 | ~11 |
| ~0.85 | ~11 |
